Honeysuckle Lane
- Do odd jobs (Uses 2 actions)
	if Global.can_action2():
		if {Inventory.has_item("Saw")}:
			Your saw helps with your work
			set {temp_money} = range(25,81).pick_random()
			set {Global.player_money} += {temp_money}
			You made {temp_money} money
			Your total money is now {Global.player_money}
			do Global.use_action()
			do Global.use_action()
		else:
			set {temp_money} = range(10,51).pick_random()
			set {Global.player_money} += {temp_money}
			You made {temp_money} money
			Your total money is now {Global.player_money}
			do Global.use_action()
			do Global.use_action()
	else:
		You don't have enough actions
- Knock at a random house and ask the resident to let you stay the night.
	label reroll_start
	set {random_chance} = range(1,100).pick_random()
	if {random_chance} <= 25:
		The family that owns the place seems to be normal.
		A dad, a mom, 2 kids and a dog.
		- Stay
			Your sleep was relatively normal.
			do Global.sleep()
		- Leave
			do Global.use_action()
		- Reroll (Costs 1 action)
			do Global.use_action()
			jump reroll_start
	if {random_chance} >= 26 and {random_chance} <= 50:
		You’ve come across an abandoned house. Clearly the place has been condemned for many, many years.
		- Stay
			You decide to sleep in here. It feels eerie but you remain safe.
			do Global.sleep()
		- Leave
			do Global.use_action()
		- Reroll (Costs 1 action)
			do Global.use_action()
			jump reroll_start
	if {random_chance} >= 51 and {random_chance} <= 75:
		An old couple greets you by the door.
		- Stay
			As you get ready to sleep you overhear their conversation about selling you to the government.
			You jump out the window and don't sleep that night.
			do Global.change_resolve(-20)
			do Global.sleep()
		- Leave
			do Global.use_action()
		- Reroll (Costs 1 action)
			do Global.use_action()
			jump reroll_start
	if {random_chance} >= 76 and {random_chance} <= 100:
		A 5 foot 10 inch redneck answers the door and lets you in his abode.
		He seems to be a big sports fan, based on all the Honeysuckle State football team decor lying all around his motor home.
		- Stay
			The redneck offers you a beer to help you fall asleep.
			You drink it like a naive green alien and knock out not soon after. You have the best sleep of your life but this towering hillbilly takes one of your catalytic converters. 
			You don't confront him because he could probably crush you simply by sitting on you.
			do Inventory.remove_item("Catalytic_Converter")
			do Global.sleep()
		- Leave
			do Global.use_action()
		- Reroll (Costs 1 action)
			do Global.use_action()
			jump reroll_start
- Break into a house and rob it (Requires crowbar)
	if {Inventory.has_item("Crowbar")}:
		set {random_chance} = range(1,100).pick_random()
		if {random_chance} <= 50:
			set {temp_money} = range(20,81).pick_random()
			set {Global.player_money} += {temp_money}
			You stole {temp_money} money
			Your total money is now {Global.player_money}
			set {temp_resolve_loss} = range(1,10).pick_random()
			set {Global.current_resolve()} -= {temp_resolve_loss}
			You lost {temp_resolve_loss} resolve
			Your total resolve is now {Global.current_resolve()}
			set {crowbar_durability} = Inventory.change_durability("Crowbar", -1)
				if {crowbar_durability} <= 0:
					Your crowbar breaks
				else:
					Your crowbar has {crowbar_durability} durability left
				do Global.use_action()
	else:
		You don't have a crowbar